From 2a3749f1c34eb9fc77d97ec3656105fa0fb4c06f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ben Williams <213356824+q8itz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:52:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] graphics: fix GRAW scene, HUD and texture rendering on
 Vulkan

- Cube fetches use explicit LOD; derivative LOD from the 3D cube
  direction was wrong in one lane per quad (green/purple lattice).
- Result exponent bias is read from fetch constant word 3.
- 4:2:2 texture formats are always expanded to RGBA8.
- Occlusion queries are split per render pass and summed at the end.
- Pipelines compile synchronously so first scene draws are not dropped.
- Freed pages are not marked valid by late resolves.
- Vblank is paced to its deadline instead of polled in bursts.
- Invalid fetch constants are allowed by default.
